<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Mi cuenta · SIGA</title>
    <style>
        :root{--ink:#182235;--muted:#667085;--line:#e5e9f1;--brand:#4b42ef;--canvas:#f5f7fb;--surface:#fff}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;color:var(--ink);background:var(--canvas);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}.shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:248px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:100vh}.sidebar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:26px 16px;color:#d8d7ff;background:#1c1a4a}.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:0 10px 34px;color:#fff;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800}.mark,.avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800}.mark{width:34px;height:34px;color:var(--brand);background:#fff;border-radius:10px}.workspace{margin:10px;color:#9996d4;font-size:.69rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.nav{padding:11px 12px;color:#fff;background:var(--brand);border-radius:10px;font-size:.93rem;font-weight:700}.sidebar-footer{margin-top:auto;padding:15px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #363373;color:#aaa8df;font-size:.78rem}.logout{width:100%;margin-top:12px;padding:9px;color:#e6e5ff;background:transparent;border:1px solid #4c4990;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit}.content{padding:30px clamp(20px,4vw,56px) 50px}.topbar,.user{display:flex;align-items:center}.topbar{justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:36px}.eyebrow{margin:0 0 5px;color:var(--brand);font-size:.74rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3vw,2.25rem);letter-spacing:-.055em}.user{gap:10px}.avatar{width:40px;height:40px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#736cff,#3730c9);border-radius:50%}.user-name{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:750}.user-role{color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem}.welcome{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:27px 30px;margin-bottom:25px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#4038d7,#635bff);border-radius:18px}.welcome:after{position:absolute;top:-105px;right:-55px;width:260px;height:260px;border:42px solid #ffffff1c;border-radius:50%;content:""}.welcome h2,.welcome p{position:relative;z-index:1}.welcome h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.35rem}.welcome p{margin:0;color:#e8e7ff;font-size:.94rem}.empty-area{display:grid;min-height:350px;place-items:center;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px}.empty-content{max-width:330px;padding:2rem;text-align:center}.empty-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:54px;height:54px;margin:auto auto 16px;color:var(--brand);background:#edecff;border-radius:16px;font-size:1.45rem}.empty-content h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.1rem}.empty-content p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:980px){.shell{grid-template-columns:72px minmax(0,1fr)}.sidebar{width:72px;padding-inline:10px}.logo span:not(.mark),.workspace,.nav,.sidebar-footer{display:none}}@media(max-width:560px){.shell{display:block}.sidebar{display:none}.content{padding:24px 16px}.user-name,.user-role{display:none}}
    </style>
</head>
<body><div class="shell">
    <aside class="sidebar"><div class="logo"><span class="mark">S</span><span>SIGA</span></div><p class="workspace">Espacio de trabajo</p><div class="nav">▦ &nbsp; Mi cuenta</div><a href="{{ route('requests.index') }}" style="display:block;padding:12px;color:#cfcef9;text-decoration:none;font-size:.93rem">▤ &nbsp; Solicitudes</a><div class="sidebar-footer">Sesión protegida<form method="POST" action="{{ route('logout') }}">@csrf<button class="logout" type="submit">Cerrar sesión</button></form></div></aside>
    <main class="content"><header class="topbar"><div><p class="eyebrow">Mi espacio</p><h1>Mi cuenta</h1></div><div class="user"><div class="avatar">{{ str(auth()->user()->name)->substr(0, 1)->upper() }}</div><div><div class="user-name">{{ auth()->user()->name }}</div><div class="user-role">Miembro</div></div></div></header><section class="welcome"><h2>Hola, {{ strtok(auth()->user()->name, ' ') }}.</h2><p>Bienvenido a {{ auth()->user()->organization?->name ?? 'SIGA' }}. Pronto encontrarás aquí tus herramientas y solicitudes.</p></section><section class="empty-area"><div class="empty-content"><div class="empty-icon">◌</div><h2>Tu espacio estará disponible pronto</h2><p>Por ahora no tienes acciones pendientes. Las funciones para miembros aparecerán aquí cuando estén habilitadas.</p></div></section></main>
</div></body>
</html>
